{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7f3e2a1-4c8d-4e5a-9f21-innerpeace0001",
    "name": "InnerPeace API",
    "description": "## InnerPeace — Yoga / Meditation / Mantra API\n\nComplete Postman collection for the InnerPeace wellness app (Next.js 16 + Prisma + SQLite).\n\n### 🚀 Quick Start\n1. Run **Auth → Login** (demo credentials are pre-filled: `demo@innerpeace.app` / `innerpeace123`).\n2. The test script automatically saves the `token` to the collection variable — every other request works instantly.\n3. IDs (`chantSessionId`, `journalId`, `createdMantraId`) are also auto-captured when you create resources.\n\n### ⚙️ Variables\n- `baseUrl` — default `http://localhost:3000`. If you run Postman outside this sandbox, point it at the reachable app host (e.g. the preview URL).\n- `token` — set automatically by Login/Register test scripts (valid 30 days).\n\n### 📌 Notes\n- **Counters are absolute, not incremental**: PATCH endpoints expect full current values (idempotent — retries never double-count).\n- **Ownership**: foreign resource IDs return `404`.\n- **Dates**: `YYYY-MM-DD`, computed in IST (+05:30).\n- Full reference: `docs/API.md` in the project.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "innerpeace"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "previewUrl", "value": "https://preview-chat-7fab88dc-7908-4535-a000-e59bade89906.space-z.ai", "description": "Sandbox preview host — copy into baseUrl if calling from outside the sandbox" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "description": "Auto-saved by Login / Register test scripts" },
    { "key": "chantSessionId", "value": "", "description": "Auto-saved when you create a chant session" },
    { "key": "createdMantraId", "value": "", "description": "Auto-saved when you create a custom mantra" },
    { "key": "journalId", "value": "", "description": "Auto-saved when you create a journal entry" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api"]
            },
            "description": "Unauthenticated smoke test. Returns `{ \"message\": \"Hello, world!\" }`."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Registered — token saved');",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.warn('Register failed:', JSON.stringify(pm.response.json()));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Test User\",\n  \"email\": \"you@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"yoga12345\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Create an account. Rules: name ≥ 2 chars, valid email, password ≥ 6 chars.\n\nErrors: `400` validation · `409` email exists.\n\n**On 201 the test script saves the token automatically.**"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (demo account)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Logged in as', body.user.name, '— token saved to collection variable');",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.warn('Login failed:', JSON.stringify(pm.response.json()));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo@innerpeace.app\",\n  \"password\": \"innerpeace123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login with the **pre-seeded demo account** (14 days of history included). Run this first — the token is saved automatically and all other requests start working."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Validate the stored token / fetch current profile. `401` means the token is missing, invalid or expired (30-day expiry)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
